earn('CHK-002 edge-1', 'races() — every trial reached the reader-at-import barrier before the genuine promotion step, and the reported repository dependency path exists');
earn('CHK-002 adversarial-1', 'judgeMatrix over the mechanically protection-removed mutant — 3/3 RED on the same fixtures, controls and forced schedule, with zero builder failures');
earn('CHK-002 adversarial-2', 'judgeMatrix injections — the same acceptance rule rejects incomplete trials, an unreached window, a builder failure, a failed control, baseline/mutant not RED, final not GREEN, and an off-target reader failure');
earn('CHK-001 happy-1', 'controls():final + races(final) — a legitimate concurrent rebuild under the production build mutex leaves both builder and reader at exit 0 with the CLI success marker and no recovery or missing-module output');
earn('CHK-001 adversarial-1', 'races(final) — three forced readiness-to-import promotions with distinct OLD/NEW generation markers, each confirming the interleaving was reached, with no mixed generation, transient ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND, recovery output or nonzero exit');
